<h2>Thank you for your purchase!</h2>
<p>Your order is confirmed and ready to enjoy.</p>

<div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0;">
  <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Item:</strong> {{itemTitle}}</p>
  <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Order ID:</strong> {{orderId}}</p>
  <p style="margin: 4px 0;"><strong>Total:</strong> {{formatCurrency total currency}}</p>
</div>

<p>
  <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">View Order</a>
</p>

<hr class="divider">
<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280;">
  A receipt has been saved to your account. You can access it anytime from your orders page.
</p>